@startuml
title SD08 - Consult Scrapped Vehicles History
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "Worker" as User
participant ":HistoryActivity" as View
participant "HistoryController" as Ctrl
participant ":HistoryService" as HistSvc
participant "restdb API" as DB
participant "Mapper" as Mapper
participant "adapter:HistoryAdapter" as Adapter
participant "vehicle:Vehicle" as Vehicle

activate User

User -> View: asks to consult the history

View -> Ctrl: getScrappedVehicles(activity, callback)
note right of Ctrl: runs in a background thread, callbacks are posted to the UI thread
Ctrl -> HistSvc: fetchScrappedVehicles(activity)
HistSvc -> DB: GET /history
DB --> HistSvc: vehicles (json)
loop for each json object
    HistSvc -> HistSvc: creates a VehicleDTO(vin, make, model, year)
    HistSvc --> HistSvc: vehicleDTO
end
HistSvc --> Ctrl: vehicleDTOList

Ctrl -> Mapper: vehicleDTOList2VehicleList(vehicleDTOList)
Mapper --> Ctrl: vehicleList

alt no vehicles found
    Ctrl --> View: onError("No vehicles were found in the data base.")
    View --> User: shows error message
else vehicles found
    Ctrl --> View: onSuccess(vehicleList)
    View --> Adapter**: create(context, vehicleList)
    View --> User: shows the list of scrapped vehicles (model and VIN)

    User -> View: taps a vehicle
    View -> Adapter: getItem(position)
    Adapter --> View: vehicle
    View -> Vehicle: getMake(), getModel(), getYear()
    Vehicle --> View: make, model, year
    View --> User: shows a popup with the make, model and year

    User -> View: closes the popup
    View --> User: hides the popup
end

@enduml
